===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|industrialisation}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|industrialisation}}. Analyzable as {{af|en|industrial|-ization}} or {{af|en|industrialize|-ation}}.

=== Pronunciation ===
{{rhymes|en|eɪʃən|s=7}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A process of social and economic change whereby a human society is transformed from a [[pre-industrial]] to an [[industrial]] state.

